+
+**@@DATE@@, cycle 0.1.5 (the plan's PD-55), at compiler `5fbaf4a`** — `SYNTAX.md` Y-24 and Y-45, `API.md` §1; per
+`meta/research/refusal-syntax-reference-engines.md`, as of 2026-10-01. Y-24 names `regex_escape` the way to match a
